      idea:["The population is the full set you want to study. Sampling selects the cases to observe. Those observed cases form the sample. A descriptive statement stays with the observations. An inferential statement uses them to learn about the wider population.", "总体是研究所关心的全部对象。通过抽样选择要观察的对象，这些对象构成样本。描述性陈述概括已观察的数据；推断性陈述用样本了解更大的总体。"],
      method:["Underline who was measured, then circle who the claim is about. If the claim reaches beyond the observed group, consider how the sample was chosen and how much uncertainty remains.", "划出实际测量了谁，再圈出结论针对谁。若超出已观察群体，要考虑抽样方式以及估计的不确定性。"],
      visual:foundationTable("Follow the people, then follow the claim",["Stage","Height survey"],[["Population","400 students at the school"],["Sample","20 selected students"],["Description","The 20 measured students average 165 cm."],["Inference","Use 165 cm to estimate the mean for all 400."]],"总体为全校 400 人，实际测量的 20 人是样本。165 厘米描述这 20 人；用它估计全校平均身高就在做推断。"),
      examples:[
        foundationExample(["Of 400 pupils, 20 are measured. Who is the population if the question concerns this whole school?","全校 400 名学生中测量了 20 人。若研究问题针对全校，总体是谁？"],["Look for the target of the question.","找研究问题的目标对象。"],["The study asks about the entire school.","研究关心整所学校。"],["All 400 pupils belong to that target.","400 人都在目标范围内。"],["All 400 pupils.","全校 400 名学生。"]),
        foundationExample(["A library has 1,000 registered users. Sixty returned a questionnaire. Which group supplied the answers?","图书馆有 1,000 名注册者，60 人交回问卷。哪组人提供了答案？"],["Separate the list of users from the responses.","区分注册名单和有效答卷。"],["Only 60 answers were received.","只获得了 60 份答卷。"],["The observed group is the responding sample.","作答者构成实际观察到的样本。"],["The 60 respondents.","60 名作答者。"]),
        foundationExample(["“Among the 60 respondents, 45 visited last week.” What kind of statement is this?","“60 名作答者中，有 45 人上周来过。”这是什么陈述？"],["Read the opening phrase.","注意句首限定范围。"],["The count concerns the people who answered.","人数只涉及作答者。"],["No claim is made about other registered users.","没有把结果推广到其他注册者。"],["Descriptive.","描述性。"]),
        foundationExample(["Using 45 of 60 responses to estimate the proportion of all users who visited last week is what kind of reasoning?","用 60 人中有 45 人来过的结果估计所有注册者上周到访的比例，属于什么推理？"],["Who appears in the conclusion?","结论针对谁？"],["The observed proportion is 45 ÷ 60 = 75%.","样本比例为 45 ÷ 60 = 75%。"],["An estimate for all users reaches beyond the 60 observed.","估计所有人的比例超出了已观察的 60 人。"],["Inferential.","推断性。"]),
        foundationExample(["All respondents were recruited inside the library. What makes an estimate of use for all registered users uncertain?","作答者都在馆内招募。用他们估计所有注册者的使用情况有什么局限？"],["Think about users who rarely visit.","想想很少到馆的人。"],["People who visit frequently have more opportunities to be approached.","常到馆者更容易被接触。"],["Their visiting patterns may differ from those of rare visitors.","他们的到访规律可能不同于很少来馆者。"],["The sample may overrepresent frequent visitors.","样本可能过多代表经常到馆的人。"])
      ],
      check:foundationCheck(["Twenty sampled students average 165 cm. Which sentence makes an inference?","抽到的 20 名学生平均身高为 165 厘米。哪句话是在推断？"],[["Exactly 20 students were measured.","实际测量了 20 人。"],["The school mean is estimated at 165 cm.","估计全校平均身高为 165 厘米。"],["The measured students average 165 cm.","被测学生平均身高为 165 厘米。"]],1,[["This states the recorded sample size. Its claim stays within the observed group.","这只陈述记录下来的样本量。"],["Correct. The word school changes the target from the observed 20 to the population.","正确。“全校”把目标从被观察的 20 人扩展到总体。"],["This describes the 20 measured students. An inference would target students beyond them.","这描述的是被测的 20 人；推断还会涉及其他学生。"]])
