      check:foundationCheck(["Both classes have a median of 70. Which statistic helps compare the spread of their scores?","两班的中位数都是 70。哪个指标有助于比较两班的分散程度？"],[["Mode","众数"],["Percentile rank of one student","某一名学生的百分位秩"],["Standard deviation","标准差"]],2,[["Mode identifies the most frequent score. It can stay the same while spread changes.","众数找出现最多的分数，离散程度变化时众数可能保持原值。"],["That locates one student's score among peers. Use a summary across the class for spread.","这描述某个学生的相对位置；要比较全班分散程度，需要全班的离散指标。"],["Correct. Standard deviation measures how much the class scores vary around their mean.","正确。标准差描述班内成绩在均值周围有多分散。"]])
